sue for a Collector. Despite the name, they don't care about something after they get it.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-12T19:29:51-07:00","id":588735,"title":"","content":"Actually I'm thinking a seductive Collector who collects submissives who aren't in the BDSM &quot;scene&quot;, they're loss being of they're &quot;innocents&quot;, once they've had a taste they can never go back. The collection never need know of each others existance.<br /> <br /> Nemisis is easiest, its not unusual for a hard core submissive to agree to give a Dom the ability to punish her, and not just &quot;punishment&quot; which is just a kinky reward, but things she does not enjoy.<br /> <br /> I ran across a feminist who is also a submissive, she has a contract with her Dom which spells out what he can and can't do, but what he can do is punish her with things she doesn't like, but is willing to do, like in this case she doesn't like really long sex, because it makes her sore the next day when she has to go to work the next day, so that is what he did when she did something that displeased him, it was consentual, but it was also a punishment. Now spanking her really isn't a punishment because she likes that, but the long sex that is punishment.<br /> <br /> A hypothetical Beast for example could punish his slavegirl by having sex with her in a lake knowing she has a fear of water, she could very well agree to that, especially if it a fear she wants to confront.<br /> <br /> BDSM is complex.<br /> <br /> As for &quot;The BDSM scene&quot;, I have a limited experience of it as all of my submissives have not been invovled in it. In fact I would not be surprised if some did not even think of it that way as many people don't realize that BDSM doesn't always require the use of bondage and restraints, or whips, floggers, or being zapped. BDSM is a strange acoynm, it uses 4 letters to represent 6, Bondage and Discipline, Dominance and Submission (my fav part), and Sadism and Maschoism.<br /> <br /> I've found finding women who are into or at least willing to do D&amp;S then S&amp;M.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-12T20:37:43-07:00","id":588803,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/583747-beast-bdsm-the-hunger-for-power?p=588735#post588735\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I ran across a feminist who is also a submissive</div> </div> </div> </div>This is not at all unusual. Just saying.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title